  What Ultra Luxury adds over Luxury — essentially the gadget-and-coddling
  layer:

  1. Head-up display — biggest daily-use item of the bunch
  2. Hands-free power trunk with kick sensor (Luxury's trunk is manual)
  3. Heated steering wheel with a wood rim
