  5. Power rear sunshade + manual rear side shades — the back-seat-passenger
  feature
  6. Parking assist with automatic braking and surround-view camera
  7. Softer semi-aniline quilted leather (vs Luxury's perforated leather) and a
  14-way driver's seat
  8. Upgraded open-pore wood and noise-reducing wheel design

  Nothing on that list changes how the car drives — it's pure comfort,
  convenience, and cabin ambiance.

